Package: lh-bitnet-infer
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Sameer Tawade <ops@logihertz.com>
Homepage: https://www.logihertz.com
Description: lh-bitnet - 1.58-Bit Ternary BitLinear Matrix Arithmetic
 C++17 1.58-bit ternary neural network (BitNet b1.58) inference engine featuring 2-bit weight packing (4 weights/byte), RMSNorm, multiplication-free SIMD (AVX2/NEON) BitLinear kernels, and Edge LLM auditor.
